-07T13:34:52.633754+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-54.1","local_name":"bob-cli-54.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-54","agent_clan_generation":"20261007092242","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-54.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-54[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Ctrl+Shift+Enter Pomodoro picker[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Ctrl+Shift+Enter on an unlinked task asks which of today's [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoros to link it into: Enter takes the current/first future [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoro, typing filters, and a new name creates a Pomodoro with [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob capture's rules, in a reliable, stale-safe, and polished [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]picker.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ctrl_shift_enter_pomodoro_picker.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-54[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-54/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pomodoro target core (pure model and explicit-target planner)[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add pure block-id-prompt helpers for capture-parity Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]names, today's open-entry model, ranked picker rows, the create intent, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and an explicit-target link planner (existing or new named entry), with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unit tests; no behavior change yet.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pomodoro link picker modal and styles[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]picker-ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker-ui: build the promise-based \"Link to today\" modal with timeline [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows, progress ring, create/invalid/blocked rows, plan-meter footer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keys, accessibility, bid-ppk styles, and DOM-stub view tests; not yet [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wired.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Wire the picker into Ctrl+Shift+Enter, notices, docs, release[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gesture[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, picker-ui[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gesture: move the inbox-route helpers out of the full fragment, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]picker mixin and preflight, route the choice through the link flow, name[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the destination in Notices, update the harness and tests, add runtime [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, bump to 1.24.0, update docs in both repos, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-54","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-54.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a440f35d1cface93d6b00bcd39c2fe1e","started_at":"2026-10-07T13:23:02.706288+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"1689333c7284f564a7cdeb03ffa63f36920612786d6dd040dd50fc9c482f302d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-54.land--gate/chat.md","size_bytes":550},"commits":{"digest":"2f77dda6b33d213b93150cb0d637c87ab97640c90ae63e1ade58bb76a4327